        "provenance/source-port-reference-gap.json"
      ],
      "result": "16 deterministic 48 kHz synth cases are byte-identical; effect-path, broader reference fixtures, source redistribution, and legal closure remain open. Exact-head adapter MIDI gate is separately verified; it does not establish source-vs-port MIDI parity."
    },
    {
      "id": "audio-contract",
      "status": "partial",
      "evidence": [
        "provenance/audio-contract.json",
        "exact_head_evidence.sample_accurate_midi_gate",
        "exact_head_evidence.suite"
      ],
      "result": "48 kHz synth contract and finite deterministic output are recorded; unsupported rates fail closed; live-input path is experimental/deferred, ratio-2 qualification and realtime allocation remain open. Exact-head 24/24 suite includes the sample-offset MIDI gate test; allocation and other open gates remain unresolved."
    },
    {
      "id": "control-map",
      "status": "partial",
      "evidence": [
        "provenance/control-map.json",
        "provenance/control-binding-gap.json",
        "provenance/ai-control-geometry-evidence.json"
      ],
      "result": "24 geometry controls identified, 5 source-backed and bound, 19 provisional; DXF has no authoritative labels and no controls were guessed."
    },
    {
      "id": "native-editor-and-knobs",
